    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_conflict_repair_impact",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-conflict-repair-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "I believe the comment was meant lightly, but the impact was different, and that is the part we need to address."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "فکر می‌کنم حرف با نیت سبک گفته شد، ولی اثرش متفاوت بود و همون بخشی‌ه که باید بهش رسیدگی کنیم."
        },
        "intent": "separate_intent_impact",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_conflict_repair_impact",
          "c2_conflict_repair_repair"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_conflict_repair_ack",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-conflict-repair-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "I can acknowledge that my wording put you in a difficult position without pretending I intended the outcome."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "می‌تونم بپذیرم که عبارت‌بندیم تو رو در موقعیت سختی گذاشت، بدون اینکه وانمود کنم قصد اون نتیجه رو داشتم."
        },
        "intent": "acknowledge_harm",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_conflict_repair_acknowledge",
          "c2_conflict_repair_accountability"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_conflict_repair_boundary",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-conflict-repair-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "The boundary is not 'never disagree with me'; it is 'do not raise personal criticism in front of the wider team.'"
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "مرز این نیست که «هیچ‌وقت با من مخالفت نکن»؛ اینه که «انتقاد شخصی رو جلوی کل تیم مطرح نکن»."
        },
        "intent": "state_boundary_precisely",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_conflict_repair_boundary",
          "c2_conflict_repair_impact"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_conflict_repair_defensive",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-conflict-repair-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "If I become defensive, the conversation shifts from what happened to protecting my self-image, which makes repair harder."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "اگر دفاعی بشم، گفتگو از اتفاقی که افتاده می‌ره سمت دفاع از تصویر خودم و ترمیم سخت‌تر می‌شه."
        },
        "intent": "avoid_defensiveness",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_conflict_repair_defensive",
          "c2_conflict_repair_repair"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_conflict_repair_rupture",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-conflict-repair-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "The rupture is small enough to repair, but only if we treat the loss of trust as real rather than trivial."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "گسست اون‌قدر کوچیکه که بشه ترمیمش کرد، ولی فقط اگر کاهش اعتماد رو واقعی بدونیم نه بی‌اهمیت."
        },
        "intent": "assess_rupture",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_conflict_repair_rupture",
          "c2_conflict_repair_repair"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_conflict_repair_restitution",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-conflict-repair-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "An apology helps, but restitution may require changing the process that allowed the same problem to happen twice."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "عذرخواهی کمک می‌کنه، ولی جبران ممکنه نیاز داشته باشه روندی که دوبار اجازه تکرار مشکل داده عوض بشه."
        },
        "intent": "design_restitution",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_conflict_repair_restitution",
          "c2_conflict_repair_accountability"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_conflict_repair_future",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-conflict-repair-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "I am willing to continue, provided the boundary is explicit and we both know what happens if it is crossed again."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "حاضرم ادامه بدیم به شرطی که مرز روشن باشه و هر دو بدونیم اگر دوباره رد شد چه اتفاقی می‌افته."
        },
        "intent": "negotiate_future_boundary",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c2_conflict_repair_boundary",
          "c2_conflict_repair_accountability"
        ],
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c2_conflict_repair_summary",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-conflict-repair-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "Repair becomes credible when acknowledgment, impact, responsibility and a concrete change all line up."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "ترمیم وقتی قابل‌باور می‌شه که پذیرش، اثر، مسئولیت و تغییر عملی با هم جور باشن."
        },
        "intent": "summarize_repair",
